title":"送邹均敷","author":"王立道","text":"清秋欲尽促归心，海日苍苍晓隔林。\n回首长安应未远，蓬莱宫阙五云深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8129,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿诗","author":"王立道","text":"摄衣欲上万言书，忽忆高堂独倚闾。\n十月江南春已应，倦游应不似相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8130,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送周嘉遇之景陵","author":"王立道","text":"燕山楚泽共微茫，细雨春帆度汉阳。\n好向鳣堂理吟卷，竟陵东渚即沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8131,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陆奎之峄县","author":"王立道","text":"洙泗回萦入古城，宫墙犹是鲁诸生。\n圣朝礼乐超千载，莫似当时不肯行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8132,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题石溪","author":"王立道","text":"磊磊白石清溪深，柳花漫天晴复阴。\n扁舟罢钓自来去，无人更识沧洲心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8133,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"王立道","text":"少妇看花泪满裳，盈盈终日不成妆。\n裁得春衣无用处，书来犹说在辽阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8134,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送倪德符知郴州 其一","author":"王立道","text":"楚南山水更多奇，五马春深度岭迟。\n问俗已穷千里目，兴来应不废吟诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8135,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送倪德符知郴州 其二","author":"王立道","text":"郴民今日总魁奇，可信昌黎爱廖师。\n更有濂溪能化俗，郡中为访种莲池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8136,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其一","author":"王立道","text":"绮阁瑶台迥碧空，春光尽在上林中。\n琼华岛上蔷薇雨，太液池头杨柳风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8137,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其二","author":"王立道","text":"春色城南更可怜，卖花种柳各纷然。\n半酣落日慵骑马，独整危襟坐水边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8138,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其三","author":"王立道","text":"满院花开锦作丛，短墙一角漏春风。\n院门深锁閒亭晚，惟有莺啼绿树中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8139,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其四","author":"王立道","text":"草蔓荒阶白日阴，亭亭塔影卧空林。\n山僧不惯迎游客，自对诸天诵梵音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8140,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其五","author":"王立道","text":"楼台白日静芳林，一径苍苔春树阴。\n独坐无心看舞鹤，石床移处落花深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8141,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其六","author":"王立道","text":"吴云越树梦中看，晓起西窗月色寒。\n此恨春风难解释，飞花无数堕阑干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8142,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其七","author":"王立道","text":"野亭流水有馀清，新雨浮萍一夜生。\n竟日独吟还独酌，故园花鸟不胜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8143,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其八","author":"王立道","text":"海棠开遍已春深，载酒重过几树林。\n地远红尘飞不到，萧然相对即禅心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8144,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴 其九","author":"王立道","text":"忆昨曾陪骢马来，高歌急管递相催。\n斜阳芳草迷归路，更把馀尊听落梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8145,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘志忠司定海训","author":"王立道","text":"乍脱风尘游海峤，况从弟子拜儒官。\n鳌山鲸浪来天外，多羡平生有大观。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8146,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人作教龙阳","author":"王立道","text":"蓟门千里下荆门，别意乡情共一尊。\n好向春风种桃李，花开正近武陵源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8147,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠周乾诗","author":"王立道","text":"为爱城南草树幽，漫携童马作春游。\n红尘杳杳斜阳路，却忆扬州十二楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8148,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送许琥作教六合","author":"王立道","text":"昨因献策滞秦关，又向金陵匹马还。\n桃李阴阴书阁闭，春风常伴一官閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8149,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜观海棠用故烧高烛照红妆韵七首 其一","author":"王立道","text":"乳燕低飞绿窗暮，开尊共惜朱颜故。\n文君窈窕夜当垆，百花失色如相妒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8150,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜观海棠用故烧高烛照红妆韵七首 其二","author":"王立道","text":"烂熳芳英夜似烧，暝烟初傍蜡痕消。\n光摇翠幕微风起，何处佳人舞绛绡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8151,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜观海棠用故烧高烛照红妆韵七首 其三","author":"王立道","text":"春色新裁蜀锦袍，看来宛转避兰膏。\n当庭欲语空凝伫，红露满枝明月高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8152,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜观海棠用故烧高烛照红妆韵七首 其四","author":"王立道","text":"仙姿冉冉娇红烛，妃子春酣睡未足。\n谪仙已去玉颜空，凭栏犹忆清平曲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8153,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜观海棠用故烧高烛照红妆韵七首 其五","author":"王立道","text":"万蕊妆成华屋春，一枝微亚金尊照。\n世人恨欠杜陵诗，此花真得无言妙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8154,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜观海棠用故烧高烛照红妆韵七首 其六","author":"王立道","text":"胭脂一树晕明红，艳色凝香清夜同。\n不解人间能有此，移根元自上阳宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8155,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜观海棠用故烧高烛照红妆韵七首 其七","author":"王立道","text":"繁条婀娜叠红芳，疑是佳人向晚妆。\n寄语东风共相惜，为留香艳伴花王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":8156,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]